# Reactive Surface Grass Module Material Report

- Date: `2026-07-12`
- Verdict: `PASS`
- Scope: one stylized Grass Static Mesh module and its Grass-only material.
- PP1 packing: per-blade pivot UV2/UV3; no Pivot Painter 2 textures.
- Vertex Color B remains a root-to-tip data channel but is not used to deform the rigid tilt.
- RT sampling occurs once at each PP1 pivot; every vertex in that blade receives one axis and angle.
- Reactive geometry control is `RS_Grass_MaxTiltDegrees`; gradient and distance-clamp deformation controls are removed.
- RT decoding: coverage-premultiplied RG is divided by A before direction decoding.
- Snow, Ground, Water, Core, and Demo were unchanged regression controls for this run, not permanent edit prohibitions.
- Mesh: `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Grass/Modules/SM_RS_StylizedGrassModule`.
- Material: `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Grass/Modules/M_RS_StylizedGrassModule`.

